{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22242","headline":"题旧写真图 · 白居易","name":"题旧写真图","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我昔三十六，写貌在丹青。\n我今四十六，衰顇卧江城。\n岂比十年老，曾与衆苦幷。\n一照旧图画，无复昔仪形。\n形影默相顾，如弟对老兄。\n况使他人见，能不昧平生。\n羲和鞭日走，不爲我少停。\n形骸属日月，老去何足惊。\n所恨凌烟阁，不得画功名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22242.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22242","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}